## Brand Summary

- **Colors**: #333333 (neutral), #FFFFFF (bg-light), #E5E7EB (bg-light), #01DBE5 (accent), #000000 (bg-dark), #7655E6 (accent), #2F2E3E (surface-dark), #0EA5E9 (accent), #0284C7 (accent)
- **Fonts**: Montserrat (400,600,700), Source Sans Pro (400,600,700)
